  "title": "Fresh videos",
  "brief": "People expect a new video to be ready within a few seconds of the upload. That is the Queue Age: how long the oldest Message has waited. Here it must stay under 5 seconds, and 10 uploads arrive every second. A slow Backlog is not an error, but while the Queue Age is over its maximum your reputation falls. Add Workers until it stays low, but every Worker costs money. Real systems add and remove Workers automatically as the Queue Age changes (autoscaling); here you choose.",
